OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's funds frozen over
OL,4,Aremoved bike lane wands
OL,5,
OL,6,FCroydon Council has had #2m of
OL,7,Ftransport funding frozen after removing
OL,8,Fprotective wands separating cyclists
OL,9,Ffrom traffic along a cycle lane that
OL,10,FTransport for London (TfL) had helped
OL,11,Ffund.
OL,13,FThe freeze was triggered when TfL
OL,14,Fspotted on the borough's mayor's
OL,15,FInstagram account that the wands on
OL,16,FLondon Road had been dismantled.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
PN,32502
SC,0002
CT,3,C
