OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F325A1788614738
OL,1,W5j 5Q5 7575747575x0w1w1 w17571
OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-$-%%%-!-%%%" ,%-$ -$%%-% ,,
OL,3,GNEWSACouncil's funds frozen over
OL,4,Aremoved bike lane wands
OL,5,
OL,6,FTfL said the council had acted without
OL,7,Fits consent, and has warned other
OL,8,Fboroughs against doing the same. It
OL,9,Fsaid funding would resume once the
OL,10,Fcouncil had repaid the #234,917 it had
OL,11,Fspent on the scheme since 2020-21.
OL,13,FThe borough's Conservative mayor Jason
OL,14,FPerry said the scheme had endangered
OL,15,Fcyclists and blocked emergency
OL,16,Fvehicles. He said the council had
OL,17,Fagreed to repay.
OL,23,APub: 05-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
